  "delta_provenance": {
    "chain": "accepted 01 view-5k payload (X, control) -> full product manifest alias (payload_sha256 + manifest_sha256, both re-hashed here) -> rows taken verbatim from the accepted obs (profile_ids digest equals the full product's); merge product payload layers/delta (manifest + payload re-hashed; its obs rows are exactly the canonical condition rows; members.csv reconciles) -> per-condition route by (cell_line, drug_parent_inchikey, dose_um) -> delta.npy row-aligned to the full row space; vehicle rows keep the accepted X - control. No pooling is recomputed here: the merge delta layer is the single source of the pooled label.",
