    "transport": "float32 .npy, shape (full_rows, 5000); treated row = its condition's merge delta row; vehicle row = full X - control. X/control are never copied: the manifest aliases the accepted 01 payload digests. The freeze writes expression = control + pooled delta with delta_kind=pooled.",
